#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0514 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: A variable ending in STMF must have a label that ends with "Imputation Flag" (or "Imput. Flag") and contains "Start" and "Time"
#note "Labels in the shapes of CDISC's own ADaMIG labels: ASTMF spells Imputation in full; XPERSTMF, XSPRSTMF and XP01STMF (sponsor names shaped as APERSTMF, ASPRSTMF and the template APxxSTMF's AP01STMF) abbreviate to "Imput." -> all accepted. The real ADaMIG names resolve to their own literal or template rows in the product and are never judged by a stem rule (PLAN-library-template-label-resolution T2 review L4), so the scenario uses sponsor names to stay on the stem leg."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
#library variable-metadata ADLBC *STMF name=*STMF label="{Start Time Imputation Flag}"
#library variable-metadata ADLBC *TMF name=*TMF label="{Time Imputation Flag}"
#library variable-metadata ADSL TRTSTMF name=TRTSTMF label="Time of First Exposure Imput. Flag"
#library variable-metadata ADSL TRxxSTMF name=TRxxSTMF label="Time 1st Exposure Period xx Imput. Flag"
dataset ADLBC class=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col ASTMF type=Char label="Analysis Start Time Imputation Flag"
col XPERSTMF type=Char label="Period Start Time Imput. Flag"
col XSPRSTMF type=Char label="Subperiod Start Time Imput. Flag"
col XP01STMF type=Char label="Period 01 Start Time Imput. Flag"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALB | x | x | x | x
---
